.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH boilertex 1  "boilertex 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
boilertex \- Generate TeX project boilerplate
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBboilertex\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A utility to declaratively create boilerplate from templates
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
boilertex\-generate(1)
Generate boilerplate from a template
.TP
boilertex\-list(1)
.TP
boilertex\-preview(1)
.TP
boilertex\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
